Configure the New Relic Terraform provider.
Import the existing New Relic resources into Terraform state.
Generate or write the Terraform code.
Commit the Terraform code into your GitHub repository.
Use GitHub Actions (or your existing CI/CD pipeline) to manage future changes.
Overall Architecture
Existing New Relic
    │
    │  (API / Terraform Provider)
    ▼
Terraform
    │
terraform import
    │
Terraform State (.tfstate)
    │
Terraform Configuration (.tf)
    │
GitHub Repository
    │
GitHub Actions
